{"id":"52990495","kind":"article","title":"3 脑科学","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/I_would_never_send_my_kids_to_school"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"我永远不会送我的孩子去学校","date":"2018-12-21","updated":"2025-08-29","votes":27,"comment_count":2,"minutes":1,"chars":382,"keywords":["神经科学","学习动机","自主学习","创造力","昼夜节律","学校教育"],"summary":"这篇《我永远不会送我的孩子去学校》章节导读称，神经科学揭示学习内驱力与奖励机制的重要性，支持自主引导、按自身节奏学习；作者也强调，学校忽视昼夜节律中的自然创造力周期，可能削弱学习与创造。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/52990495","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"Mrvo3j07\">神经科学为我们提供了反对学校教育的最有力论据。</p><p data-pid=\"dape23CV\">能够重塑教育最根本的力量之一，便是<b><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/I_would_never_send_my_kids_to_school#learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a></b><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。只有理解了学习内驱力，我们才能认识到，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Self-directed_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自主引导</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Self-paced_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自主节奏</a>的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Self-learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自主学习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>才是培养博学且富有创造力的头脑的最高效途径。学习内驱力中的神经奖励机制，引导我总结出了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/I_would_never_send_my_kids_to_school#Fundamental_law_of_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习的基本规律</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。我希望未来的孩子们永远不会容忍任何对这一规律的违背。</p><p data-pid=\"CzB8TLx-\">除了导致学习效率低下，学校教育制度还犯下了另一项极其浪费的罪过——那就是对<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/I_would_never_send_my_kids_to_school#Natural_creativity_cycle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自然创造力周期</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>的漠视。在这个周期中，知识在清醒和睡眠的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Circadian_cycle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">昼夜节律</a>交替中被获取、创造性地建构、拓展和优化。现行的学校系统大多设计于 19 世纪，在那个时代，我们对创造力周期的存在还一无所知。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"QY2qX5oS\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"52990307\" href=\"#/post/52990307\">上一章：2 Motto 箴言</a></p><p data-pid=\"pVj0quLs\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"52990549\" href=\"#/post/52990549\">下一章：4 Learn drive 学习内驱力</a></p><p data-pid=\"ar8g_VeS\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/73383015\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">返回目录</a></p><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"6CGFMQdk\">原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/I_would_never_send_my_kids_to_school#Brain_science\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3 Brain science</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 4 学习内驱力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"52990549\" href=\"#/post/52990549\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 自学 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"353404375\" href=\"#/post/353404375\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 学习的基本规律 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"273225977\" href=\"#/post/273225977\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 自然创造力周期 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"68262875\" href=\"#/post/68262875\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"52990307","title":"2 题记","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":21,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 我永远不会送我的孩子去学校"},{"id":"52990549","title":"4 学习内驱力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":199,"minutes":7,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 我永远不会送我的孩子去学校"},{"id":"68262875","title":"12 自然创造力周期","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":87,"minutes":24,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"273225977","title":"学习的基本规律","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":137,"minutes":4,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"353404375","title":"自我导向/自定进度/自学","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":198,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2518236084","title":"有点小钱，内卷时代的学生还有学习的必要吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":45,"minutes":1,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 45 赞同","evidence":"推荐阅读目录中的篇章链接锚点“脑科学”指向此篇译文，属于明确标题/关键词提及。"}]}